# 3D monster pipeline intermediates (tools/monsters3d/README.md): the padded
# inputs, restyled renders and TRELLIS turntables are rebuilt by the scripts.
# The raw <id>.glb meshes are not ignored: render_cards.sh builds the card
# sheets from them.
tools/monsters3d/*.mp4
tools/monsters3d/*_in.png
tools/monsters3d/*_white.png
tools/monsters3d/*_3dlook.png
tools/monsters3d/__pycache__/
